AngstromAccumulatorSource::growthInside
├── given current tick is within [tickLower, tickUpper)
│   └── it returns globalGrowth minus outsideBelow minus outsideAbove.
├── given current tick is below tickLower
│   └── it returns outsideBelow minus outsideAbove.
├── given current tick is at or above tickUpper
│   └── it returns outsideAbove minus outsideBelow.
├── given all growth values are zero
│   └── it returns zero.
└── given growthInside has been computed
    └── it satisfies conservation: growthInside + outsideBelow + outsideAbove == globalGrowth (in-range case).

AngstromAccumulatorSource::globalGrowth
├── given pool has accumulated rewards
│   └── it returns the cumulative global growth from storage.
└── given pool has no rewards
    └── it returns zero.

AngstromAccumulatorSource::epochOf
├── given block number and epoch length
│   └── it returns blockNumber divided by epochLength.
└── given block number is zero
    └── it returns zero.

AngstromAccumulatorSource::epochLength
└── it returns the configured epoch length.
